# Virtual environment
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Video files — excluded on purpose:
# 1. Size — even a handful of clips adds up fast in a git repo
# 2. UR Fall Detection Dataset license is non-commercial / research use
#    only and doesn't permit redistribution — so raw dataset clips and
#    our generated annotated videos should never be pushed to GitHub.
# CSV logs (the actual evidence of testing) are NOT ignored — those stay.
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov

